### 前置说明
# 文档接口接收文件相对路径（filePath），文件本体需先通过 FileCommandController 上传获取。
# 示例：先执行 FileCommandController.http 中的 upload 请求，将返回的 filePath 填入下方 {{filePath}}。

### create
POST {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/document/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user_123",
  "title": "",
  "directoryId": "20260822021101120000013024",
  "tags": ["知识库", "agent"],
  "visibility": "public",
  "visibleTo": [],
  "filePath": "upload/2026/08/25/2da3cb77023c43bb90f2d54d61659b7f_1787670493978_知识库平台 Agent.md"
}

### update-metadata
POST {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/document/update-metadata
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user_123",
  "documentId": "your-document-id",
  "title": "产品手册 V2",
  "summary": "更新后的摘要",
  "directoryId": "your-directory-id",
  "tags": ["产品", "手册", "V2"],
  "visibility": "public",
  "visibleTo": []
}

### update-content
POST {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/document/update-content
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user_123",
  "documentId": "your-document-id",
  "changeLog": "更新价格信息",
  "filePath": "upload/2026/08/22/96348d2c9b7d4341989adc5ca8fb7f95_1787386266592.md"
}

### delete
POST {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/document/delete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user_123",
  "documentId": "your-document-id"
}

### restore
POST {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/document/restore
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user_123",
  "documentId": "your-document-id"
}

### rollback
POST {{httpUrl}}/api/v1/document/rollback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user_123",
  "documentId": "your-document-id",
  "targetVersionId": "your-version-id"
}
